  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "While still playing Five Hole Jade Flute Gu, He Feng Yang sends three Five String Zither Gu from his body. Amidst the flute music, the zither plays a crisp tune, turning into this enslavement path killer move. Innumerable flying cranes stream outward while countless others fly toward the center.",
