        "sys_killer_moves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The battlefield moves like ordered gears at huge scale: the cranes change formation fluidly, like flowing water. The two mysterious Gu Immortals caught inside feel like beans in a stone grinder, about to be turned into pulp. He Feng Yang stays at the center on a desolate crane’s back and keeps the flute going while the crane group fights.",
